    {
      "element_id": 1010603,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "她似乎剛剛搞砸了自己實戰測驗。\n或許過於傳統的武器並不適合如今的時代，她決定與你同行。",
          "text_key": "language_10004466"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1010801,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "尋水杖",
          "text_key": "language_10004476"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1010901,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1010902,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "普通收集物",
          "text_key": "language_10004484"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1011101,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "拿穩藏好，當心被有心之人收入囊中。",
          "text_key": "language_10004490"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1011102,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "它是你的了。",
          "text_key": "language_10004494"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1011201,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你已知曉了如何鼓舞士氣。",
          "text_key": "language_10004497"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1011202,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你們將一同離開，遠離獨行的危險。",
          "text_key": "language_10004501"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1011301,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1011401,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你已掌握了如何精確刻度的旋律。",
          "text_key": "language_10004508"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020101,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020201,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020501,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020601,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "1.6深眠域調整補償郵件結束時間",
          "text_key": "language_10004535"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020602,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "新式擂臺賽",
          "text_key": "language_10004538"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020701,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020801,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1020901,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "一切順利——但結果似乎並不理想。看來你們的配料表需要重新更新了。",
          "text_key": "language_10004548"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1021001,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "威脅已經清除。",
          "text_key": "language_10004552"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1021101,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "節日後遺症",
          "text_key": "language_10004556"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
