          "text_key": "language_10004568"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030101,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030102,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "扎手，多刺，且血統純正。",
          "text_key": "language_10004579"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030201,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030202,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "粗壯術杖-熱切",
          "text_key": "language_10004585"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030501,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "困於自發的夢，或人造的夢。",
          "text_key": "language_10004589"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030601,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "細微的啃噬聲無所追尋，它們暫時離去了。",
          "text_key": "language_10004596"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030701,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "老拐杖-幸運",
          "text_key": "language_10004600"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030801,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "簇生羊毛剪-幸運",
          "text_key": "language_10004608"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1030901,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "一條乏味的配方脫穎而出。",
          "text_key": "language_10004612"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1031001,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1031002,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "不論如何，現在你能滿足自己的好奇心了。",
          "text_key": "language_10004619"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1031201,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1031301,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1031302,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你與恐懼漸行漸遠。",
          "text_key": "language_10004633"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1031401,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1031402,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "政治家，保潔員，或是年輕的醫師。人們各有其責。",
          "text_key": "language_10004640"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1040101,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1040401,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1040701,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "所有人都聽到了你的聲音，所有人都知曉了你的態度。",
          "text_key": "language_10004658"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1040801,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你暫時還不想接受任何邀請，林地足夠舒適，足夠自由。",
          "text_key": "language_10004662"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1040901,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "這片林地無法容納太多居民，總有人得另尋新家。",
          "text_key": "language_10004667"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1041101,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1041201,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "他們的辦法行不通，樹木並不做夢。",
          "text_key": "language_10004678"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1041401,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你應得的勝果。",
          "text_key": "language_10004682"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1041601,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1041602,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你贏得了掌聲與敬意。",
          "text_key": "language_10004688"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1041701,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 1041801,
