      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "古董銀劍-振奮+振奮",
          "text_key": "language_10004750"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 12101102,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "你為樂章畫上了休止符。",
          "text_key": "language_10004753"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 12101103,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15103001,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "伴隨烏盧魯運動會的重新舉辦，部分體育專案將引來革新。",
          "text_key": "language_10004860"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15103002,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15103001 and EpisodeFinish=1510109"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "在報導中，運動會的合規申報流程被誇大並曲解，復興小隊的聲譽被抹黑。",
          "text_key": "language_10004863"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15103003,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15103002 and EpisodeFinish=1510110"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "報告對本耶普的特徵與習性進行了詳盡的說明，該資料或有助於復興小隊與這一怪物的對抗實踐活動。",
          "text_key": "language_10004866"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15103004,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15103003 and EpisodeFinish=1510111"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "其上的印刷文本回顧了體育與這片陸地的淵源，其中的隻言片語提及了“烏盧魯運動會”。",
          "text_key": "language_10004869"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15103005,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15103004 and EpisodeFinish=1510112"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "它記錄著那些酣暢淋漓的故事，烏盧魯的傳奇，以及一個年幼的夢。",
          "text_key": "language_10004872"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15104001,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "他鼓勵了一位年輕的科研人員在“輪迴者”這個方向一直走下去。同時，他也願意提供力所能及的支援。",
          "text_key": "language_10004876"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15104002,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15104001 and EpisodeFinish=1510108"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "槲寄生枝葉-行動",
          "text_key": "language_10004879"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15104003,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15104002 and EpisodeFinish=1510109"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "羅勒蜜罐-幸運",
          "text_key": "language_10004882"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15104004,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15104003 and EpisodeFinish=1510110"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "它出自一個孩童之手，文筆稍顯稚嫩，但已能從中預見他的研究熱情所在。",
          "text_key": "language_10004885"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "element_id": 15104005,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "ChapterMapElement=15104004 and EpisodeFinish=1510111"
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "它們本來是一對座位緊鄰的門票，但它已找不到它的“兄弟”，大概是它的主人遺落在了逃跑途中。",
          "text_key": "language_10004888"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}